Mission of TLC Mobile is to make it as easy for business to talk with clients all over the world as it is to talk with their friends

Our goal
Create a universal messaging platform for business, which allows companies to communicate with customers by any of the possible ways of modern mobile communication. We want to make sure that the client does not adjust to the company and chooses the way of interaction, the technologies of which are available to the company, and that the client uses the most convenient method at the given time interval - by SMS Messaging, Voice, Messengers or Chat.

Who we are
Our company has united specialists with more than 10 years of experience in the field of telecommunications, each person from our team knows perfectly what modern business needs and how to improve his life with the help of mobile marketing. We try to add in our service all the latest and relevant technologies that will make a universal product that will embody all the best from the world of telecom.

Our principles
We build our company's work on the following basic principles:
1) Happy customers;
2) Timely innovation;
3) Customer support at any time;
4) Respect for everyone;

Join us and be part of our frienly team.

TFM Networks is a Leading UK based, Business Only Telecoms Business:

•	We provide customer specific, secure communications solutions for mainly UK businesses by delivering fixed and mobile solutions that are robust, scaleable and focused on business outcomes not technology;
•	Products and Services include, telephone lines / calls, internet access, mobile handsets, hosted voice, wireless and roaming data services;
•	We operate by providing tailored but NOT bespoke solutions – specializing in adapting off the peg connectivity services from wholesale carriers and tier one providers to form tailored end user communications solutions 
•	Our special partnerships and enhanced buying-power enables us to offer the most competitive prices;    
•	Our approach to technology is flexible, allowing us to quickly bring new and innovative products and services into our portfolio rather than being reliant on one or two core partners. The result a solution that is agile on its feet and able to meet the specific and rapidly changing needs of our customers;
•	Our products and services have been brought together (often across multiple sites with multiple suppliers and systems) by our Managed Services wrap. This allows us to offer our customers a single point of contact, a dedicated UK based Technical Support Centre and a proactive Account Management team all underpinned by Professional Support Services. 


The result – TFM is one of the fastest growing network operators in the UK, an organisation that is different, delivering innovative, secure, value for money and fit for purpose products and services that give our customers a real competitive edge.
We would really appreciate an opportunity to meet to discuss your business further. We are confident that we can not only improve your current telecommunication needs but also future-proof your business – and often also save you money. 

If you are interested in finding out more, please contact us at hello@tfmnetworks.co.uk

